From: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: camcc-sc8280xp: Mark CAMNOC/AHB RCGs shared

The camnoc_axi, slow_ahb and fast_ahb RCGs use plain clk_rcg2_ops, so
they keep their last configuration when their branch clocks are turned
off. After the camera subsystem (camss) has been used once, the CAMNOC
AXI RCG is left pointing at camcc_pll0_out_even, which is then disabled
because nothing else references it. The next collapse of titan_top_gdsc
happens with a dead clock on the CAMNOC interface: the power-down
completes without the isolation step (CFG_GDSCR bit 19 stays clear) and
the following power-up never reaches PWR_ON:

  titan_top_gdsc status stuck at 'off'
  WARNING: drivers/clk/qcom/gdsc.c:185 gdsc_toggle_logic+0x14c/0x160
  qcom-camss ac5a000.camss: Failed to power up pipeline: -110

Observed on a Huawei MateBook E Go (sc8280xp) with the hi846/ov13b10
sensors: the first capture works, every later one fails until reboot.
Reading the RCG through debugfs after one capture shows
camcc_camnoc_axi_clk_src at 150 MHz with parent camcc_pll0_out_even
while camcc_pll0 has enable_count 0.

Mark the three RCGs shared so that they are parked on XO when disabled,
as camcc-sm8150, camcc-sc8180x and camcc-x1e80100 already do for the
same clocks. With this change the camera power domain collapses and
powers up cleanly across repeated captures.

Fixes: ff93872a9c61 ("clk: qcom: camcc-sc8280xp: Add sc8280xp CAMCC")
Signed-off-by: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/camcc-sc8280xp.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/camcc-sc8280xp.c
index e4ec7e3..5ba6e54 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/camcc-sc8280xp.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/camcc-sc8280xp.c
@@ -667,7 +667,7 @@ static struct clk_rcg2 camcc_camnoc_axi_clk_src = {
 		.name = "camcc_camnoc_axi_clk_src",
 		.parent_data = camcc_parent_data_2,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(camcc_parent_data_2),
-		.ops = &clk_rcg2_ops,
+		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_ops,
 	},
 };
 
@@ -835,7 +835,7 @@ static struct clk_rcg2 camcc_fast_ahb_clk_src = {
 		.name = "camcc_fast_ahb_clk_src",
 		.parent_data = camcc_parent_data_0,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(camcc_parent_data_0),
-		.ops = &clk_rcg2_ops,
+		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_ops,
 	},
 };
 
@@ -1370,7 +1370,7 @@ static struct clk_rcg2 camcc_slow_ahb_clk_src = {
 		.name = "camcc_slow_ahb_clk_src",
 		.parent_data = camcc_parent_data_0,
 		.num_parents = ARRAY_SIZE(camcc_parent_data_0),
-		.ops = &clk_rcg2_ops,
+		.ops = &clk_rcg2_shared_ops,
 	},
 };
 
